title: Buttermilk Pancakes
servings: 8

## ingredients
2 cups all-purpose flour
1 3/4 cups buttermilk
1 1/2 tsp baking powder
1/2 tsp baking soda
2 tbsp granulated sugar
1 tsp salt
2 large eggs
3 tbsp butter, melted
a pinch of nutmeg

## method
Whisk the flour, baking powder, baking soda, sugar and salt in a large bowl.
Whisk the eggs, buttermilk and melted butter in a jug.
Fold the wet into the dry until just combined; lumps are fine and overmixing is not.
Rest the batter for ten minutes while the pan heats over medium heat.
Cook in batches until bubbles form and the edges set, then flip once.
